&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Lead a multi-level, multi-functional ER organization with strategic influence across regions for Coupang Rocket Fulfillment Center.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Set the technical and performance bar for ER practices and compliance standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Design and implement company-wide ER strategies, including risk governance and labor-management stability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Drive simplification and process improvement while managing complex, high-stakes ER issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Establish contingency plans and lead proactive risk management to protect organizational integrity.&lt;/li&gt;
