&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;The Assistant General Counsel, Labor &amp;amp; Employment (“AGC”) will play a key role in supporting Strive Health’s People Team on the full range of issues that may arise during employment. The AGC will also oversee all labor and employment-related litigation and manage outside law firms who represent the Company on labor and employment related matters. The AGC will also support the Company in its strategic relationships with labor and employment related suppliers and other vendors. The AGC will report to the General Counsel and will work out of Strive Health’s Denver headquarters at least two days per week.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
